// AA-gun burst pool (+0x5D070) draw set-up in the scratchpad: guard-band bounds (0x002B89B4..C0 ->
// +0x5EC..+0x5F8), the far depth (+0x578) and fade range ((near - far) / C 0x0040ED18, +0x57C), the
