// EE: 0x001829D8
// Cannon-shell ground-impact pool (+0x60D00) draw set-up: guard band, far depth and fade range
// (/ C 0x0040ED2C), colour 0x002B8560 +0x38..+0x3A with alpha base +0x3B (+0x648), the corner
// offsets 0x002B8B3C..48 (+0x6B0..+0x6BC), w = 1 for the puff vector (+0x4AC) and the depth bias
// ((camera distance - C 0x0040ED30) / C 0x0040ED34 x C 0x0040ED38, +0x624).
