// EE: 0x001A2BE0
// Sky glare sheets of missions 0xF and 0x24, drawn while the camera is at least the band height
// (0x004104D4 +0xC4) x C 0x0040F450 up: header (bucket 1, alpha 0x48), guard band +-0x4000,
// distance fade (+0x578 / +0x57C) and the camera's yaw / pitch axes (+0x500 / +0x4F0). The alpha
// base (+0x648) is 24, raised with the camera height up to band x C 0x0040F458. The sun direction
// (0x00110240 of the terrain's angles +0x88 / +0x8C) flattened to the ground must face the camera's
