// = alpha x C 0x0040FD1C, faded below camera height C 0x0040FD20. Each layer is 128 segments i
// around the camera (sine table 0x002B8670 x +0x66C, half steps interpolated), the bottom edge at
// height (r x C 0x0040FD28 + C 0x0040FD2C + +0x668 x wave) x 0.75, the top at
// (C 0x0040FCFC - r x C 0x0040FD30) x C 0x0040FD34; the y of the points is the sine table and the
