// EE: 0x001FF858
// Body of a flame segment between the projected circles a (larger, centre colour +0x14, radius
// +0x10) and b, seen along screen direction `ang` with tangent half-angle `half`: 16 rim offsets at
// scratchpad 0x70000000 (pairs at ang +- (C 0x0040FEEC + k x C 0x0040FEF0), k = 0..7, radius b's
// until the step passes `half`, a's from then on (that step s)), the tangent offsets of both
// radii at ang + half (0x70000100 / +0x110) and ang - half (+0x120 / +0x130). Through the GIF
// builder gb: a gouraud fan around a (PRIM 0x4D, 19 - 2 s vertices: centre, tangent, the rim
// points from s on, other tangent), one around b (2 s + 3 vertices, the rim points before s) and
// two 4-vertex strips (PRIM 0x4C) joining the tangent edges; centres in full colour, rims alpha 0.
